        "💰 You found 50 coins!",
        "💰 You found 120 coins!",
        "💎 JACKPOT! You found a diamond!",
        "🪙 You found an old coin!",
        "⚔️ You found a rare sword!",
        "🍀 Lucky day! Bonus reward!",
